---
source: crates/krishiv-optimizer/tests/it/rules.rs
expression: "SELECT t.a FROM t JOIN u ON t.a = u.a WHERE t.a > 3 AND t.a <= 9 AND u.a IN (4, 5, 6)"
---
Project [a#0]
+- Join Inner, (a#0 == a#3)
   :- Filter (((isnotnull(a#0) and (a#0 > 3)) and (a#0 <= 9)) and (a#0 IN (4, 5, 6)))
   :  +- Scan spark_catalog.default.t [a#0]
   +- Filter (((isnotnull(a#3) and (a#3 IN (4, 5, 6))) and (a#3 <= 9)) and (a#3 > 3))
      +- Scan spark_catalog.default.u [a#3]
